       census's `L/L_\odot`. At 0.85rem it overran the panel edge and `overflow:
       hidden` clipped it — measured, left 733 against a panel starting at 734. */
    inset-inline-start: 1.15rem;
    inset-block-start: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-90deg);
    transform-origin: center;
    line-height: 1;
